    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "āryamahāpratisarāvidyādhāraṇī",
      "segment_number": 2
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "om namo bhagavatyai āryamahāpratisarāyai |",
      "segment_number": 3
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "namo buddhāya namo dharmāya namaḥ saṃghāya | namaḥ sarvatathāgatebhyo namaḥ sarvabuddhabodhisattvebhyo 'tītānāgatapratyutpannebhyo namaḥ |",
      "segment_number": 4
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "om vipulagarbha vipulavimale vimalagarbhe vimale jayagarbhe vajrajvālāgarbhe gatigahane gaganaviśodhani sarvapāpaviśodhani | om guṇavati gaganavicāriṇi-gaganavicāriṇi giri-giri giriṇi-giriṇi gabhari-garddhabhari gamari-gamari gabhari-gabhari gaha-gaha gargāri-gargāri gagari-gagari gaṃbhari-gaṃbhari gabhi-gabhi gahi-gahi gamani-gamani guha-guha guru-guru (",
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_131",
          "segment_number": 6
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": ") guruṇi cale mucale samucale guhaṇi-guhaṇi guruṇi-guruṇi culu-culu cale-cale mucale jayavijaye jayavati aparājite sarvabhayavigate sarvagarbhasaṃrakṣaṇi siri-siri bhiri-bhiri miri-miri giri-giri piri-piri samantākarṣaṇi sarvaśatrūn pramathani rakṣa-rakṣa māṃ sarvasattvāṃśca sarvadā bhayebhyaḥ sarvopadravebhyaḥ sarvavyādhibhyaḥ cili-cili viri-viri dhiri-dhiri vigatāvaraṇaviśodhani vividhāvaraṇavināśini | muci-muci muri-muri muli-muli kili-kili mili-mili kamale vimale-vimale jayavijayāvahe jayavati viśeṣavati bhagavati ratnamakuṭamālādhari bahuvividhavicitraveśadhāriṇi | bhagavati mahāvidyā devi rakṣa rakṣa māṃ sarvasattvāṃśca samantātsarvapāpaviśodhani | hulu-hulu mulu-mulu rakṣa-rakṣa māṃ sarvasattvānāñcā(ttvāṃścā)nāthānatrāṇāna(nni)rayanānaśaraṇānaparāyaṇān parimocaya sarvaduḥkhebhyaḥ | caṇḍi-caṇḍi caṇḍini-caṇḍini vegavati sarvaduṣṭanivāriṇi vijayavāhini | huru-huru curu-curu turu-turu āyuḥpāla(li)ni suravarapramathani sarvadevagaṇapūjite | ciri-ciri viri-viri samantāvalokite prabhe-prabhe suprabhe suprabhaviśuddhe sarvapāpaviśuddhe sarvapāpaviśodhani dhuru-dhuru dharaṇidhare dhara-dhara sumuja sumuru-sumuru ru ru cale cālaya sarvaduṣṭān pūrayāśān (",
          "segment_number": 7
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_132",
          "segment_number": 8
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": ") māttaṅgini śrīvapudhare jayakamale kṣiṇi-kṣiṇi varadāṅkuśe | om padmaviśuddhe śodhaya-śodhaya śuddhe-śuddhe bhara-bhara bhiri-bhiri bhuru-bhuru maṅgalaviśuddhe | pavitramukhi khaḍgini-khaḍgini khara-khara jvalitaśikhare-jvalitaśikhare samantāvalokitaprabhe suprabhaviśuddhe samaṃtāt prasāritāvabhāsitaviśuddhe jvala-jvala sarvadevagaṇasamākarṣaṇi satyavrate | om hrīṃṃ traṃ tara-tara tāraya māṃ bhagavati sarvasattvāṃśca nāgavilokite laghu-laghu lahu-lahu hulu-hulu hutu-hutu turu-turu tuhu-tuhu kiṇi-kiṇi kṣiṇi-kṣiṇi sarvagrahabhakṣaṇi piṃgari-piṃgari mucu-4 sumu-sumu suvicale tara-tara nāgavilokini tāraya māṃ bhagavati sarvasattvāṃśca saṃsārārṇavāt bhagavati aṣṭamahādāruṇabhayebhyaḥ | sarvatra samantena diśābandhena vajrapāśabandhane vajrajvālini vajrajvālāviśuddhe | bhuri-bhuri bhara-bhara bhiri-bhiri bhuru-bhuru bhagavati garbhaviśuddhe garvasaṃśodhani kukṣisaṃpūraṇi rakṣa-rakṣaṇi | jvala-jvala cara-cara | om jvālini varṣantu(tu) devaḥ samantena divyodakena amṛtavarṣaṇi devatāvatāriṇi | abhiṣiñcatu māṃ sugatavaravacanāmṛtavapuṣe | rakṣa-rakṣa māṃ sarvasattvāṃśca sarvatra sarvadāsarvabhayebhyaḥ sarvopasargebhyaḥ sarvaduṣṭabhayabhītebhyaḥ sarvakalikalahavivādasarvabhayaviśodhani duḥsvapna-durnimittā-maṅgalapāpaviśodhani kukṣisaṃpūraṇi sarvayakṣarākṣasanāgavidāriṇi bala-bala balavati jaya-jaya vijaya-vijaya jayatu sarvatra sarvakālaṃ siddhayantu(tu) me iyaṃ mahāvidyā sādhaya maṇḍalaṃ (",
          "segment_number": 9
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_133",
          "segment_number": 10
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": ") ghāṭaya vidhnān jaya-jaya sidhya-sidhya budhya-budhya pūraya-pūraya pūraṇi-pūraṇi pūraya me āśāṃ vidhodgatamūrte jayottari jayakari jayavati tiṣṭha-tiṣṭha bhagavati samayamanupālaya\nsarvatathāgatahṛdayaviśuddhe vyavalokaya māṃ sarvasattvāṃśca sarvāśāṃ paripūraya sarvasattvānāñca trāyasva māmaṣṭamahādāruṇabhayebhyaḥ sara-sara prasara-prasara sarvāvaraṇaviśodhani samantākāra - viśuddhe vigate-vigate vigatamale sarvamalaviśodhani sarvamaṅgalaviśuddhe | kṣiṇi-kṣiṇi sarvapāpaviśuddhe | malavigate jayavati tejovati vajravati | vajre vajravati | om trailokyādhiṣṭhite svāhā | sarvatathāgatamūrdhābhiṣikte svāhā | sarvatathāgatahṛdayādhiṣṭhite hṛdaya svāhā | sarvatathāgatasamaye siddhe svāhā | indre indravati indravyavalokite svāhā | brahme brahmādhyuṣite svāhā | sarvatathāgatādhiṣṭhite svāhā | viṣṇunamaskṛte svāhā | maheśvaravaṃdita-pūjitāya svāhā | vajradharavajrapāṇibalavīryādhiṣṭhite svāhā | dhṛtarāṣṭrāya svāhā | viruḍhakāya svāhā | virupākṣāya svāhā | vaiśravaṇāya svāhā | caturmahārājanamaskṛtāya svāhā | yamāya svāhā | yamapūjitanamaskṛtāya svāhā | varuṇāya svāhā | vāruṇāya svāhā | mārutāya svāhā | mahāmārutāya svāhā | agnaye svāhā | vāyavye(ve) svāhā | nāgavilokitāya svāhā | devagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | nāgagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | yakṣagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | rākṣasagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | gandharvagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | apasmāragaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | asuragaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | garuḍagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | kinnaragaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | mahoragagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | manuṣyagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | amanuṣyagaṇebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvagrahebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvanakṣatrebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvabhūtebhyeḥ svāhā | (",
          "segment_number": 11
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_134",
          "segment_number": 12
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": ") sarvapretebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvapiśācebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvāpasmārebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvakubhāṇḍebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvapūtanebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvakaṭhapūtanebhyaḥ svāhā | sarvaduṣṭapraduṣṭebhyaḥ svāhā | om dhuru-dhuru svāhā | om turu-turu svāhā | om kuru-kuru svāhā | om curu-curu svāhā | om muru-muru svāhā | om hana-hana sarvaśatrūn svāhā | om daha-daha sarvaduṣṭān svāhā | om paca-paca pratyarthikān pratyamitrān svāhā | ye mamāhitaiṣiṇasteṣāṃ sarveṣāṃ śarīraṃjvālaya-jvālaya sarvaduṣṭacittānāṃ svāhā | vajrajvālāya svāhā | samaṃtajvālāya svāhā | maṇibhadrāya svāhā | pūrṇabhadrāya svāhā | samantabhadrāya svāhā | mahāsamantabhadrāya svāhā | ākāśamātṝṇāṃ svāhā | samudragāminīnāṃ svāhā | rātricarāṇāṃ svāhā | divācarāṇāṃ svāhā | trisandhyācarāṇāṃ svāhā | velācarāṇāṃ svāhā | avelācarāṇāṃ svāhā | garbhaharebhyaḥ svāhā | garbhadharebhyaḥ svāhā | garbhahāriṇībhyaḥ svāhā | garbhasaṃdhāriṇībhyaḥ svāhā | calu-calu svāhā | hulu-hulu svāhā | om svāhā | bhūḥ svāhā | bhuvaḥ svāhā | svaḥ svāhā | bhurbhuva ḥ[sva] svāhā | cili-cili svāhā | dharaṇī svāhā | dhāraṇī svāhā | agneḥ svāhā | tejovāyū svāhā | cili-cili svāhā | sili-sili svāhā | mili-mili svāhā | budhya-budhya svāhā | maṇḍalabandhe svāhā | sīmābandhe svāhā | sarvaśatrūn bhaṃjaya svāhā | jambhaya-jambhaya svāhā | stambhaya-stambhaya svāhā | cchinda-cchinda svāhā | bhinda-bhinda svāhā | bhaṃjaya-bhaṃjaya svāhā | bandha-bandha svāhā | mohaya-mohaya svāhā | maṇiviśuddhe svāhā | sūrye sūryaviśuddhe svāhā | śodhani svāhā | viśodhani svāhā | candre-candre pūrṇacandre (",
          "segment_number": 13
        },
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_135",
          "segment_number": 14
        },
        {
          "tag": "text",
          "text": ") svāhā | grahebhyaḥ svāhā | nakṣatrebhyaḥ svāhā | piśācebhyaḥ svāhā | śivebhyaḥ svāhā | viśvebhyaḥ svāhā | śāntibhyaḥ svāhā | puṣṭibhyaḥ svāhā | svastyayanebhyaḥ svāhā | garbhaharebhyaḥ svāhā | śivaṃkari svāhā | śāntikari svāhā | puṣṭikari svāhā | balavarddhani svāhā | śrīkari svāhā | śrīvarddhani svāhā | balavarddhanakari svāhā | śrījvālini svāhā | muci svāhā | namuci svāhā | vegavati svāhā | om svāhā | sarvatathāgatamūrte pravaravigate vigatabhayasva me bhagavati sarvapāpasvastirbhavatu mama sarvasattvānāñca svāhā | om muni-muni vimuni-vimuni dhari-dhari cari-cari valane bhagavati bhayaharaṇi-bhayaharaṇi bodhi-bodhi bodhaya-bodhaya budhiri-budhiri cuṃbili-cuṃbili svāhā | sarvatathāgatahṛdayajuṣṭe svāhā | om muni-muni munivare abhiṣiñca māṃ saparivāraṃ sarvasattvānāñca sarvatathāgatāḥ sarvavidyābhiṣekairmahākavacamudrāmudritaiḥ sarvatathāgatahṛdayādhiṣṭhitaśuddhe mudre vajre svāhā | samantajvālāmālāviśuddhisphuritacintāmaṇirmahāmudrāhṛdayāparājitāmahādhāraṇī |",
          "segment_number": 15
        }
      ],
      "segment_number": 5
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "punarevamaparamantrāḥ siddhāḥ sarvakarmakarāḥ śubhāḥ |",
          "segment_number": 16
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "sarvakāmaṃdadā bhadrāsyaṃprabhāṣe śṛṇuṣva ca ||",
          "segment_number": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "tadyathā om amṛtavare vara-vara pravara viśuddhe hūṃ-hūṃ phaṭ-phaṭ svāhā | om amṛtavilokini garbha saṃrakṣaṇi ākarṣaṇi hūṃ hūṃ phaṭphaṭ svāhā | aparājitāhṛdayam |",
      "segment_number": 18
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "om vimale vipule jayavare jayavāhini amṛtaviraje hūṃ hūṃ phaṭphaṭ svāhā | om bhara-bhara saṃbhara-saṃbhara indriye balaviśodhani hūṃ hūṃ phaṭphaṭru ru cale svāhā | om maṇidhari vajriṇi mahāpratisare hūṃ hūṃ phaṭphaṭ svāhā | upahṛdayavidyā |",
      "segment_number": 19
    },
    {
      "tag": "note",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_136"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "asyāḥ śravaṇamātreṇa sarvapāpakṣayaṃgatā |",
          "segment_number": 20
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yayā yukto vajrakāyo namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yāṃsmaran rāhulo rakṣa mātaraṃkukṣisaṃsthitaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 22
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "prakṣipte yo viṣanadyāṃ namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 23
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yo rakṣedvaṇijaḥ putraṃ krūrasarpavadhodyatam |",
          "segment_number": 24
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "viṣadāhamu .... ṣaśca namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 25
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "brahmadatto mahārājo yayā rakṣitamaṣṭakaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 26
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "ripuṃjitvāvirājo 'bhūnnamastasyai manassadā ||",
          "segment_number": 27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "bhikṣuduḥśīlako rogī yayā kaṇṭhe prabandhitaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 28
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "prāṇāmukto yayai svargaṃ namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 29
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "samudre potasaṃkṣubdhe vaṇijānprāṇarakṣakaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 30
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yāṃ smaransārthavāho 'bhūnnamastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 31
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yayā pratibaddhāyāṃ bhāryāyāṃ sutamāptavān |",
          "segment_number": 32
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "prasāritabhujo rājā namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 33
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "daridrāṃyāṃ pratismṛtvā dīnāraṃ pradadau jine |",
          "segment_number": 34
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "rājājiṣṭa pradātābhūnnamastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 35
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yāṃ prabuddhāsurairbaddho .... cūḍāmaṇau prabhuḥ |",
          "segment_number": 36
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "labdhavānvijayaṃ vajrī namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 37
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yasyāvantabalenaiva pūrya pāramitāṣaṭ |",
          "segment_number": 38
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "mārāñjitvā jinā buddhā namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 39
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "aparādhī vadhārho'pi prakṣiptaḥ sarvasaṃkaṭe |",
          "segment_number": 40
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yāṃ smṛtaḥ parimuktobhūnnamastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 41
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "note",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_137"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yayā bandhitakaṇṭhaśca muktopāyasaṃkaṭāt |",
          "segment_number": 42
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "nagare nāyakobhūnnamastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 43
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yā cāparājitāvijyā(dyā)sarvabuddhaiśca dhāritā |",
          "segment_number": 44
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "mudritā bhāṣitā nityaṃ paṭhitā paradeśitā ||",
          "segment_number": 45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "likhitā moditā sattvahitāya pūjitā sadā |",
          "segment_number": 46
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "smṛtvā kāyagatāṃ kṛtvā namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 47
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yasyāḥ śravaṇamātraṃca durlabha bhuvanatraye |",
          "segment_number": 48
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "pāṭhasvādhyayanaṃ vāpi namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 49
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yā vidyā durlabhā buddhairvyākṛtā saṃpraśaṃsitā |",
          "segment_number": 50
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "mahatī dhāraṇī khyātā sarvapāpakṣayaṃkarī ||",
          "segment_number": 51
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "mahābalā mahāsarppā mahātejā mahatprabhā |",
          "segment_number": 52
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "mahāguṇavatī vidyāsarvamāravidāriṇī ||",
          "segment_number": 53
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "pāpasaṃdhisamudghāṭī māramadapramocanī |",
          "segment_number": 54
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "jananī bodhisattvānāṃ sarvaduṣṭavināśinī ||",
          "segment_number": 55
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "rakṣiṇī poṣiṇī dhātrīparamantravighāṭinī |",
          "segment_number": 56
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "kākhorddaviṣayogānāṃ vidhvaṃsanakarīśivā ||",
          "segment_number": 57
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "mahāyānaratānāñca gṛhṇatāṃ likhatāṃ tathā |",
          "segment_number": 58
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "pāṭhādhyayanakṛtāṃ nityaṃ dadhatāṃ śrūyatāṃ tathā ||",
          "segment_number": 59
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "parebhyo diśatāṃ caiva nityaṃ manasi bhāvitām |",
          "segment_number": 60
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "sapustakagatāṃ kṛtvā pūjyamānyanamaskṛtam ||",
          "segment_number": 61
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "sarvapāpaharī bhadrā bodhisaṃbhārapūraṇī |",
          "segment_number": 62
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "namastasyai namastasyai namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 63
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yasyā mantraprabhāveṇa sarvabhaya upadravāḥ |",
          "segment_number": 64
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "duṣṭāsuramanuṣyāśca daityagandharvarākṣasāḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 65
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "note",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_138"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "grahāḥ skaṃdā apasmārāḥ piśācā yakṣakinnarāḥ |",
          "segment_number": 66
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "ḍākinyaḥ śākinīsaṃghā nāgāḥ kāṣordda tu vyādhayaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 67
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "jvarāśca vividhā rogāḥ parakarmakṛtāstathā ||",
          "segment_number": 68
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "viṣāgniśastramantrāṇi vidyutaḥ kālabādhayaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 69
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "ativṛṣṭiranāvṛṣṭiḥ sarvaśatrubhayāni ca ||",
          "segment_number": 70
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "tathānye 'pyupasargā vā vinaśyanti na saṃśayaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 71
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "sarvakāryāṇi siddhayanti namastasyai namo namaḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 72
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yaśca tāṃ dhārayet vidyāṃ kaṇṭhe vāhau ca mastake |",
          "segment_number": 73
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "nityaṃ rakṣanti devāstaṃdaityā nāgāśca mānuṣāḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 74
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "gandharvā kinnarā yakṣā bhūtapretapiśācakāḥ |",
          "segment_number": 75
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "ḍākinyo rākṣasādūtyaḥ kumbhāṇḍāḥ kaṭapūtanāḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 76
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "trisandhyaṃ yaḥ paṭhet nityaṃ buddhārakṣanti taṃ sadā |",
          "segment_number": 77
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "pratyekāḥ śrāvakāścaiva bodhisattvāmaharddhikāḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 78
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yoginaḥ siddhamantrāśca mahāvīryamaharṣayaḥ |",
          "segment_number": 79
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "vajrapāṇiśca yakṣendraḥ śakraśca tridaśaiḥ saha ||",
          "segment_number": 80
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "catvāraśca mahārājā brahmā viṣṇurmaheśvara |",
          "segment_number": 81
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "nandikeśo mahākālaḥ kārtikeyo gaṇeśvaraḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 82
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "bhairavā mātṛkā durgāstathānye mārakāyikāḥ |",
          "segment_number": 83
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "vidyādevyo mahāvīryā mahābalaparākramāḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 84
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "māmakī bhṛkuṭītārā cāṅkuśī vajraśṛkhalā |",
          "segment_number": 85
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "mahāśvetā mahākālī vajradūtīmupāśikā ||",
          "segment_number": 86
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "vajramālā mahāvidyā suvīryā'mṛtakuṇḍalī |",
          "segment_number": 87
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "vajrāparājitā caṇḍī kālakarṇā mahābalā |",
          "segment_number": 88
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "tathā dhanyā mahābhāgā padmakuṇḍalireva ca ||",
          "segment_number": 89
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "note",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "hi",
          "attributes": {
            "rend": "bold"
          },
          "text": "Mpv-Dh_139"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "maṇicūḍā puṣpadantī svarṇakeśī ca piṃgalā |",
          "segment_number": 90
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "ekajaṭā mahādevī dhanyā vidyutsumālinī ||",
          "segment_number": 91
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "kapālinī ca raṃ(laṃ)keśī kṣudrākṣītyekanāyikā |",
          "segment_number": 92
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "hārīti pāñcikā caiva śaṃkhinīkūṭadantinī |",
          "segment_number": 93
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "śrī sarasvatī lakṣmīḥ siddheśvarī sadānugā ||",
          "segment_number": 94
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "tamevānye 'pi rakṣanti yasya vidyā kare sthitā |",
          "segment_number": 95
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "sa bhavet sarvasattvānāṃ mokṣaṇārthaṃ samudyataḥ ||",
          "segment_number": 96
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "rājāno vaśagāstasya puṇyarāśiṃvivardhayet |",
          "segment_number": 97
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "siddhayante sarvakalpāśca praviṣṭo jinamandire ||",
          "segment_number": 98
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "ante bauddhapadaṃ yāyājjinasya vacanaṃ yathā |",
          "segment_number": 99
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "yā strī dhārayed vidyāṃ prasūyedgurviṇī sukham ||",
          "segment_number": 100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "aputrā labhate putraṃ vyādhimuktā sukhāśinī |",
          "segment_number": 101
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "dhanadhānyairvarairyuktā mānanīyā priyaṃvadā ||",
          "segment_number": 102
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "lg",
      "attributes": {},
      "children": [
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "susvapnānāṃ satyakarī jinakṣetraṃ samāpnuyāt |",
          "segment_number": 103
        },
        {
          "tag": "l",
          "attributes": {},
          "text": "ityavocad bhagavān sā ca sarvāvatī parṣadabhyanandan || iti ||",
          "segment_number": 104
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "attributes": {},
      "text": "āryamahāpratisarāvidyādhāraṇī samāptā ||",
      "segment_number": 105
    }
  ]
}